msgstr "Aktiver Chatbot:"

#: includes/config/wdgpt-config-reporting-settings.php:103
msgid "Enable reporting:"
msgstr "Aktiver rapportering:"

#: includes/addons/wdgpt-addons-license-settings.php:183
msgid "Enter your email address to get access to our free addons."
msgstr ""
"Oppgi e-postadressen din for å få tilgang til våre gratis tilleggsutvidelser."

#: includes/addons/wdgpt-addons-license-settings.php:91
msgid ""
"Enter your SmartSearchWP Premium license key to enable the premium features. "
"You can find your license key in your SmartSearchWP account, after "
"purchasing the premium version of the plugin."
msgstr ""
"Skriv inn SmartSearchWP Premium-lisensnøkkelen din for å aktivere "
"premiumfunksjonene. Du finner lisensnøkkelen din i SmartSearchWP-kontoen din "
"etter å ha kjøpt premiumversjonen av plugin-en."

